1
00:00:00,263 --> 00:00:01,933
(Sheldon:)Tomorrow.

2
00:00:02,431 --> 00:00:04,431
(Sheldon:)Yes, I'll pay.

3
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:06,430
All right, goodbye.

4
00:00:06,602 --> 00:00:08,602
All right.

5
00:00:08,771 --> 00:00:11,401
(Sheldon:)Time to learn rock climbing.

6
00:00:19,198 --> 00:00:22,488
(Sheldon:)You know, I am a fan of ventriloquism.

7
00:00:22,660 --> 00:00:26,290
(Sheldon:)Maybe you, me and your dummy
could go get a hot beverage.

8
00:00:26,455 --> 00:00:28,955
(Sheldon:)He could talk while you drink.

9
00:00:29,458 --> 00:00:31,958
Nope. I wanna climb some rocks.

10
00:00:37,008 --> 00:00:42,598
(Sheldon:)This appears significantly more monolithic
than it did on my laptop.

11
00:00:43,139 --> 00:00:47,639
You know, one expects to see hominids
learning to use bones as weapons.

12
00:00:47,810 --> 00:00:49,980
- Hey, you afraid of heights, Cooper?
- Hardly.

13
00:00:50,146 --> 00:00:52,476
A fear of heights is illogical.

14
00:00:52,648 --> 00:00:56,028
(Sheldon:)Fear of falling, on the other hand,
is prudent and evolutionary.

15
00:00:56,652 --> 00:00:58,742
(Sheldon:)What would you say
is the minimum altitude...

16
00:00:58,905 --> 00:01:02,025
(Sheldon:)...I need to achieve to cement
our newfound friendship?

